### 로그인 1
POST http://localhost:19091/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mgr1@email.com",
  "password": "Hash123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.data.accessToken)
    client.log("test: " + client.global.get("access_token"))
%}

