### 로그 아웃
POST http://localhost:19091/auths/logout
Authorization:Bearer {{access_token}}

### 업체 관리자 승인
POST http://localhost:19091/auths/approve/6

### 회원 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:19091/auths

### 회원 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:19091/auths/1

### 회원 검색 1
GET http://localhost:19091/auths/search?email=mgr3@email.com

### 회원 검색 2
GET http://localhost:19091/auths/search?email=mgr1@email.com

### 내 정보 조회
GET http://localhost:19091/auths/me
Authorization:Bearer {{access_token}}

### 내 정보 수정
PUT http://localhost:19091/auths/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "username": "manager1",
  "nickname": "mgr1"
}



